{"source_record":81,"t":"2026-10-26T16:16:03.476Z","elapsed_s":636.925,"kind":"note","op":"log","reaction":"Scouts, not an attack. And the report goes person by person: Tamar sleeping three levels down, Kian and Meryem and Yusuf sleeping above ground, all would have been caught. That is very clear and a little chilling; it is the clearest the hill has ever been with me. They searched my passage six levels down too. They may return with more riders, and my two safe squares are still chalk. I rang the bell and they slept anyway.","game_clock":"Evening · 1 Sep · year 1","engagement":null,"reason":null,"t_source_lexeme":"\"2026-10-26T16:16:03.476Z\"","elapsed_s_source_lexeme":"636.925","raw_line_sha256":"6ed14f0b5e576dd25292a21f9c2c2bf5ae249e8961af842bb9ebe3131fcff01b"}
